rpt":"yooo love this place. got oxtails, jerk & curried chicken and a drink next door. everything - from the food to the service to the outdoor seating - was amazing. can't wait to go back!!"},{"business_id":"4h88UgiaoNt3P0r97VJrow","review_id":"29loSmmSxNLJ9NfFqkJ2BA","date":"2018-05-20T22:03:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156458973884583,"text_excerpt":"Stumbled upon Deja Vieux food park on Tchoupitoulas and became a huge fan of Johnny's Jamaican Grill. I tried out the ox tail entrée and was very impressed! The ox tail was well seasoned and so juicy. The platter came with rice, sautéed spinach, and plantains - which was more than enough to fill me up! The owner, Johnny, is also very friendly. I've been back 3 times already and would recommend to anyone craving Jamaican!"},{"business_id":"4h88UgiaoNt3P0r97VJrow","review_id":"QolpOEyYEFPH0l7uhH6mqg","date":"2021-01-05T17:48:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9002883434295654,"text_excerpt":"The BEST Jamaican Jerk I've personally had and would argue the best in the city. The plantains were super ripe and chicken was excellently seasoned I personally just like more sauce which they gave me. I chose to opt out of the greens though."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4h88UgiaoNt3P0r97VJrow","photo_id":"_CqZSUKM_1DbRom4L4drXQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_CqZSUKM_1DbRom4L4drXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
